@fact grimsby.books
# en: Keeps the village bookshop. He will find anything except what you came in for.
text [034041] = 开着村里的书店。你要什么他都找得到，唯独找不到你进门要的那本。

@fact grimsby.wrong
# en: The book he gives you instead is, more often than not, the one you needed.
text [2be71b] = 他塞给你的那本“错书”，多半正是你需要的。
# en: Meet him at Grimsby's Books.
hint [ab66da] = 在格林斯比书店结识他。

@fact grimsby.parcels
# en: He posts books to students he thinks need them, on credit, and has never once chased a debt.
text [5362f8] = 他会把他觉得学生需要的书赊账寄过去，从没催过一次债。
# en: Become a regular at Grimsby's Books.
hint [4e08a9] = 做格林斯比书店的常客。

@fact grimsby.lighthouses
# en: He has a weakness for lighthouses, and when he closes the shop, it is usually to go and look at one.
text [f1d0ca] = 他对灯塔情有独钟；他关店的时候，通常就是去看某座灯塔了。
# en: Visit Grimsby's Books while you still carry the borrowed wand.
hint [878bd7] = 趁你还带着借来的魔杖，去格林斯比书店。

@fact grimsby.nose
# en: He finds a book by its smell. The right book, he says, smells right.
text [f5d641] = 他凭气味找书。他说，对的书闻起来就是对的。
# en: Visit Grimsby's Books.
hint [7f2e99] = 去格林斯比书店看看。

@fact grimsby.upper_floor
# en: Above the shop is a floor of remainders nobody mentions, up a ladder whose third and fourth rungs break.
text [6396e3] = 书店楼上有一层没人提起的滞销书，要爬一架梯子上去，梯子的第三和第四级都会断。
# en: Keep visiting Grimsby's Books.
hint [25b1c2] = 常去格林斯比书店。
